you are falling hundreds of feet a second. Your vision blurs as space and time rush quickly around you. All in an instant you find yourself at the end of time, but something is different...\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered The Void.\n\n---\n\nBixie Warfront\n_When you click the Bixie Warfront portal, you see:_\nThrough the clouded portal you see projections of bixies marching in formation. Yet when you try and step through the portal nothing happens. You are not yet attuned to the Doomscale's gate to the Bixie Warfront.\n_Head to the Stone Hive (in the Serpent's Spine) and access the Bixie Warfront through there, and then use the portal in the Bixie Warfront to zone into the Ethernere Tainted West Karana:_\nYou now feel attuned to the Doomscale gateway.\n_You are now attuned to the Bixie Warfront._\n\n---\n\nDead Hills\n_When you click the Dead Hills portal, you see:_\nThrough the clouded portal you see projections of a bleak mountainside. Yet when you try and step through the portal nothing happens. You are not yet attuned to the Doomscale's gate to The Dead Hills.\n_Head to Dulak's Harbor (connects through the Stonebrunt Mountains of Odus) and access the Dead Hills through there:_\nYou sneak below deck and wait for the Stormwave to set sail for the Dead Hills.\n_Then use the portal in the Dead Hills to zone into the Ethernere Tainted West Karana:_\nYou now feel attuned to the Doomscale gateway.\n_You are now attuned to the Dead Hills._\n\n---\n\nNeriak Fourth Gate\n_When you click the Neriak portal, you see:_\nThrough the clouded portal you see projections of a dark cave. Yet when you try and step through the portal nothing happens. You are not yet attuned to the Doomscale's gate to Neriak - Fourth Gate.\n_Head to the city of Neriak and into Neriak Third Gate, and access the Fourth Gate through there. Then use the portal in Neriak Fourth Gate ( **click for map image**) to zone into the Ethernere Tainted West Karana:_\nYou now feel attuned to the Doomscale gateway.\n_You are now attuned to Neriak Fourth Gate._\n\n---\n\nTower of Rot\n_When you click the Tower of Rot portal, you see:_\nThrough the clouded portal you see the lonely flickering of torchlight in a darkened hall. Yet when you try and step through the portal nothing happens. You are not yet attuned to the Doomscale's gate to the Tower of Rot.\n_Head to the newly opened area of the Dead Hills (the southwestern part of the zone) and click on the doorway into the Tower of Rot. Then head to its Ethernere portal ( **click for map image**):_\nYou now feel attuned to the Doomscale gateway.\n_You are now attuned to the Tower of Rot._\n\n---\n\nArgin-Hiz\n_When you click the Argin-Hiz portal, you see:_\nThrough the clouded portal you see projections of a great tower of flame. Yet when you try and step through the portal nothing happens. You are not yet attuned to the Doomscale's gate to Argin-Hiz.\n_Head to the Southern Desert of Ro to the area just east of the Wizard spires, where you'll see a giant burning tree. Clicking on this will zone you into Argin-Hiz. Just east of the zone-in inside Argin-Hiz is the portal to the Ethernere Tainted West Karana._\nYou now feel attuned to the Doomscale gateway.\n_You are now attuned to Argin-Hiz._\n\n---\n\n**Map Points**\nFor \"neriakc.txt\" map file:\nP 1720.1530, -908.5995, -68.4489, 0, 0, 0, 1, To\\_Neriak\\_Fourth\\_Gate\nFor \"dulak.txt\" map file:\nP 92.3786, 1160.7670, -31.9980, 0, 0, 0, 1, To\\_the\\_Dead\\_Hills\nFor \"stonehive.txt\" map file:\nP 393.1629, -594.5096, 37.8295, 0, 0, 0, 1, To\\_the\\_Bixie\\_Warfront\n\n---\n\n**Map Images**\n!\n!\n!\n!\n!\n!\n!\n!",
