      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ethernere Tainted West Karana [zone=939]\n**Who:**\n- Tunguska [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a steam soul [npc=44216]\n- a steamhide crocodile [npc=44220]\n- a water soul [npc=44237]\n- a water spirit [npc=44238]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Oct 8 05:18:40 2013\nModified: Sat Feb 22 08:45:01 2025 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Tunguska ( **click for map image**) in the Ethernere Tainted West Karana. He's located at about -1000, 380, -315 -- in the Qeynos camp in the northwestern part of the zone._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tunguska'\nTunguska says, 'Oh, my Gods! Another green recruit. Listen up. It's pandemonium out here; we need strong soldiers. My tasks will separate the wheat from the chaff. Are you up for the challenge, [rookie]?'\nYou say, 'Rookie?!'\nTunguska says, 'There are plenty of enemies out there, scrub. Pick your doom.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'We Shall Fight Them on the Beaches'.\nTunguska doesn't want help from inexperienced heroes. Prove yourself by performing the tasks he requested.\nThe enemies you seek are scattered throughout the Ethernere.\n\n---\n\nDispatch crocodiles, water spirits, water souls, and steam souls to prove your worth 0/10 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_These are found in the very far south-central and southwestern part of the zone._\nTunguska will be happy to hear you survived 0/1 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n75 platinum",
