      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ethernere Tainted West Karana [zone=939]\n**Who:**\n- Requisitioner Sheon [ _Raid Merchant, Rank III Spells_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Spell\n**Quest Items:**\n- Captured Essence of Ethernere [item=113134]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Bixie Warfront: Raid Instance #1 [zone=945]\n- Dead Hills: Raid Instance #1 [zone=946]\n- Ethernere Tainted West Karana: Raid Instance #1 [zone=944]\n- Neriak Fourth Gate: Raid Instance #1 [zone=947]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Raid Expedition: Houses of Thex [quest=7287]\n- Raid Expedition: Saving Jacyll [quest=7262]\n- Raid Expedition: The Doomscale Horde [quest=7253]\n- Raid Expedition: Xulous Prime [quest=7273]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Oct 9 16:03:10 2013\nModified: Fri Dec 5 20:23:11 2025 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_See Requisitioner Sheon [npc=44021] ( **click for map image**) in the Ethernere Tainted West Karana._\nYou say, 'Hail, Requisitioner Sheon'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'Hello, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. If you have been as interested in the [disturbances] as we have, and are working to [prevent] further problems, I may be able to [assist] you.'\nYou say, 'How do we prevent more problems?'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'We know fighting the intruders can help solve the initial problem -- perhaps let these fields feed Qeynos once again -- but there must be deeper [causes] at the root, and I will gladly offer my [assistance].'\nYou say, 'What disturbances?'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'Look around you. This was once a gentle plain, inhabited by farmers, animals, and the occasional bandit. Now, there's a war going on, and we're not entirely sure how to [stop] it.'\nYou say, 'What are the causes?'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'I know not what they are, but I am certain these few intruders you see here or elsewhere are not the masters of their own actions. If you can discover these truths you may take a step towards saving us all. I pray you can.'\nYou say, 'How do we stop it?'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'We know fighting the intruders can help solve the initial problem -- perhaps let these fields feed Qeynos once again -- but there must be deeper\nYou say, 'How about that assistance?'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'If you have worked towards defeating the major players in this upheaval, I can offer you [items] or [knowledge] that can help you in your fight.'\nYou say, 'What items?'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'Impress me with your deeds, and I will offer you items of power.'\nYou say, 'What about that knowledge?'\nRequisitioner Sheon says 'If you have managed to capture a bit of the essence of Ethernere, I can give you knowledge of a new ability.'\nBring her a Captured Essence of Ethernere [item=113134] (from any Call of the Forsaken raid), and in exchange, receive a Rank III spell, tome or song for your class.\n\n---\n\n**Rewarded Spells**\n**While we have the list of what is believed to be all rewarded spells, we are lacking some information as to the order of rewards. If you can confirm in which order your class receives their spells, please let us know.**\nBard\nSong: War Chorus of Protan Rk. III\nSong: Psalm of the Forsaken Rk. III\nSong: Brusco's Burning Call Rk. III\nSong: Garath's Insult Rk. III (please upload this to Lucy)\nSong: Corpseflower's Assonant Binding Rk. III\nBeastlord\nTome: Monkey's Spirit Discipline Rk. III\nTome: Focused Clamor of Claws Rk. III\nSpell: Spiritual Unity Rk. III\nBerserker\nTome: Open Wound Rk. III\nTome: Festering Rage Rk. III\nTome: Phantom Ass