      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Ethernere Tainted West Karana [zone=939]\n**Who:**\n- Marla Gaslow [ _Heroic Adventures_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 75\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Blue Diamond Wedding Band [item=115025]\n- Gem Studded Goblet [item=115022]\n- Miller Family Portrait [item=115021]\n- Patchwork Quilt [item=115026]\n- Vibrant Leaf [item=115068]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Ethernere Tainted West Karana: Protected Passage [zone=972]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Arnie Gaslow [npc=45977]\n- Beth Miller [npc=45978]\n- Burning Bones [npc=45656]\n- Delma McMannus [npc=45980]\n- Dewie McDaniel [npc=45979]\n- Einhorst McMannus [npc=45981]\n- Fredrick Gaslow [npc=45982]\n- Hefholm McMannus [npc=45983]\n- Helen Harris [npc=45984]\n- Holhaf McMannus [npc=45985]\n- Holhoff McMannus [npc=45986]\n- Jorlhoff McMannus [npc=45987]\n- Jorlrod McMannus [npc=45988]\n- Lily McDaniel [npc=45989]\n- Prilhan McMannus [npc=45991]\n- Ron Miller [npc=45990]\n- Ryshorn McMannus [npc=45992]\n- Sahen McMannus [npc=45993]\n- Sharhessa McMannus [npc=45994]\n- Skarhaem McMannus [npc=45995]\n- Tessa Miller [npc=45996]\n- Tresma McMannus [npc=45997]\n- Willie Harris [npc=45998]\n- a bandit gutpiercer - CotF - 3 [npc=45969]\n- a callous bandit - CotF - 3 [npc=45970]\n- a fire mephit [npc=45971]\n- a flesh eater [npc=45972]\n- a ghoul [npc=45973]\n- a leafy treant [npc=46017]\n- a scorched walker [npc=45974]\n- a skeleton - Ethernere Tainted West Karana [npc=45975]\n- a traitorous guard [npc=45976]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Daily Task: Heroic Adventures [quest=7988]\n- Marla #1: A Helping Hand [quest=7402]\n- Marla #2: Seeking Refuge [quest=7403]\n**Era:** | !Call of the Forsaken\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Jan 22 03:52:52 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**Call of the Forsaken Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n**About Heroic Adventures**\n\\- Heroic adventures in Call of the Forsaken scale in level: As low as **Level 75** and up to current maximum level.\n\\- Scale is based on the highest level player **present in the zone** and affects difficulty, loot quality, and mob levels.\n\\- There is some variation/randomization in the task steps you'll be assigned as you progress through the task.\n\\- Time of completion will vary by your group's makeup (anywhere from 30-90+ minutes).\n\\- Collection items appear as ground spawns midway through tasks (you'll see an emote indicating their appearance).\n\\- Named mobs (or their PHs) spawn midway through tasks (usually, but always, at the same time collection items appear).\n\\- These tasks have individual **3-hour lockout timers** (timer gained upon completion).\n**Experience in Heroic Adventures**\n\\- Mobs in these instances grant some experience, but the bulk of experience is **earned upon task completion**.\n\\- As of a patch in November 2014, less difficult tasks were tuned to reward less experience and more difficult ones were tuned to reward more.\n\\- For an added experience bonus, check out **Guard Hamarn's \"Daily Tasks\"** [quest=7988].\n\n---\n\n_This is a heroic adventure (1-6 players) that begins with Marla Gaslow ( **click for map image**) in the Ethernere Tainted West Karana. She is located in the guard camp where the Guild Hall portal sends you (/loc -1000, 345, -315)._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Level 75\n\\- Completed \"A Helping Hand\" (heroic adventure)\n\\- Completed \"Seeking Refuge\" (heroic adventure)\n\n---\n\n**TASK SUMMARY**\n\\- Say \"help\" to request the task and \"ready\" to zone in.\n**Step #1:**\n\\- Speak to Einhorst McMannus 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update.\n**Step #2:**\n\\- Kill the Harrowing Horde that block the path between the village and the camp 0/14\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (creatures of the Ethernere).\n\\- Kill the undead that block the path between the village and the camp 0/14\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (undead).\n\\- Kill the bandits that block the path between the village and the camp 0/14\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update (bandits).\n**Step #3:**\n\\- Speak with Fredrick Gaslow 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update.\n**Step #4:**\n\\- Kill the fire mephits that surround Ron Miller 0/12\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\n\\- Recover the villager's missing possessions from traitorous guards 0/4\n\\-\\-\\- Kill traitorous guards and loot different items until you've gotten four updates.\n\\- Heal the injured villagers using vibrant leaves from the nearby treants 0/4\n\\-\\-\\- Kill treants and loot 4x \"Vibrant Leaf\"; right-click the leaf on injured villagers.\n**Step #5:**\n\\- Speak with Fredrick Gaslow 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update.\n**\\- The task LOCKS at this point.**\n**\\- At this point in the task, collectibles spawn in the zone (ground spawns) and a named (or its PH) has a chance to spawn.**\n**Step #6:**\n\\- Ensure the path is clear so the villagers can reach the McMannus camp safely 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Kill four waves of mobs (three mobs per wave that spawn as ambushes).\n**Step #7:**\n\\- Inform Einhorst McMannus of the refugee's arrival 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update.\n\\- As soon as the objective for Step #7 is done, the task completes.\n\n---\n\n**MAP**\n!\n\n---\n\n**NAMED MOBS**\n_\"Burning Bones\" (or its PH, \"a scorched walker\") has a chance to spawn after the fifth step is completed. Known loot from this named:_\nLevel 100\nCadaverous Hunk of Infected Flesh\nHighwater Bracer\nSplinter of Potency\nLevel 95\nAiry Drape of the Wind\nLevel 90\n??\nLevel 85\n??\n\n---\n\n**TASK IN DETAIL**\n========================================================================\nTRIGGERING THE TASK\n========================================================================\nYou say, 'We'll help'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Protected Passage'.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nMarla Gaslow says 'This way, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Ethernere Tainted West Karana.\n========================================================================\nSTEP #1\n========================================================================\nSpeak to Einhorst McMannus 0/1 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Einhorst McMannus is inside the western hut in the McMannus camp._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #2\n========================================================================\nKill the Harrowing Horde that block the path between the village and the camp 0/14 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update in the hills to the east (creatures of the Ethernere)._\n=====================\nKill the undead that block the path between the village and the camp 0/14 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update in the hills to the east (undead)._\n=====================\nKill the bandits that block the path between the village and the camp 0/14 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update in the hills to the east (bandits)._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #3\n========================================================================\nSpeak with Fredrick Gaslow 0/1 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Head east to find Fredrick Gaslow and villagers. They are located south of the burning fields (his response depends on the next step)._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #4\n========================================================================\nKill the fire mephits that surround Ron Miller 0/12 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Standard kill update._\n\\- Rom Miller is to the east in a Burning Building surrounded by mobs to kill. (mine was the one north of the spot on the map)\n=====================\nRecover the villager's missing possessions from traitorous guards 0/4 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill traitorous guards and loot different items until you've gotten four updates._\n_The items you're looking for:_\n\\- Blue Diamond Wedding Band\n\\- Gem Studded Goblet\n\\- Miller Family Portrait\n\\- Patchwork Quilt\n=====================\nHeal the injured villagers using vibrant leaves from the nearby treants 0/4 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill treants and loot 4x \"Vibrant Leaf\", then right-click the leaf on injured villagers._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #5\n========================================================================\nSpeak with Fredrick Gaslow 0/1 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Hail Fredrick Gaslow to update the task._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #6\n========================================================================\nEnsure the path is clear so the villagers can reach the McMannus camp safely 0/1 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: After completing the previous step, the villagers move to a certain location. Once you move to their location, you get ambushed by 3x \"a traitorous guards\" or 3x undead mobs. Kill those, then the villagers move again. Repeat this three times (for a total of 12 mobs in four ambushes) to update this step._\n_Ambush mobs each hit for a max ~13,500 and have an average amount of hitpoints. They are stunnable, mezzable, and rootable. When they initially spawn, they aggro whoever triggered them (even through invisibility), but their aggro can be dropped, and they can be split-pulled from there._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #7\n========================================================================\nInform Einhorst McMannus of the refugee's arrival 0/1 (Ethernere Tainted West Karana)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Hail update to complete._\n\n---\n\n**TASK REWARDS**\n\\- a varying amount of platinum\n\\- a varying amount of experience\n\\- a varying number of Marks of Valor (currency used to buy group gear)\n- Airy Drape of the Wind [item=101750]\n- Boots of Latent Ether [item=114720]\n- Cadaverous Hunk of Infected Flesh [item=114726]\n- Mark of Valor [item=113459]",
